
--- testing ordinal of simple choice type: ---

PASS ordinal: got 0
PASS ordinal: got 1
PASS ordinal: got 2
PASS ordinal: got 4
PASS ordinal and as_string in call to f: got ordinal is 4 for instance[choice bool i64 u8 void String]
